#. Type: boolean
#. Description
#: ../templates:1001
msgid "Enable additional network privileges for ICMP probing?"
msgstr "¿Desea activar privilegios de red adicionales para el sondeo ICMP?"

#. Type: boolean
#. Description
#: ../templates:1001
msgid ""
"/usr/bin/prometheus-blackbox-exporter requires the CAP_NET_RAW capability to "
"be able to send out crafted packets to targets for ICMP probing."
msgstr ""
"«/usr/bin/prometheus-blackbox-exporter» requiere que la capacidad CAP_NET_RAW "
"esté activada para enviar paquetes preformados a los objetivos del sondeo "
"ICMP."

#. Type: boolean
#. Description
#: ../templates:1001
msgid ""
"ICMP probing will not work unless this option is enabled, or prometheus-"
"blackbox-exporter runs as root."
msgstr ""
"El sondeo ICMP no funcionará hasta que active esta opción o ejecute "
"prometheus-blackbox-exporter como súperusuario."
